hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"80","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo wuzu kare woh naak jhade. Aur jo pathron se istinja kare woh taaq adad mein kare.'"
"81","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh us ki chaar shakhan ke darmiyan baithe, phir us se koshish kare to us par ghusl hai. Matar ne is mein izafa kiya: Agarche mani na nikle."
"82","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh us ki chaar shakhan ke darmiyan baithe, phir koshish kare to us par ghusl hai."
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dho, un mein ek martaba mitti se."
"84","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek qaum ko wuzu khane se wuzu karte dekha to kaha: Wuzu poora karo, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aidiyon (ke khushk rah jane) ke liye jahannam ki aag se kharabi hai.'"
"85","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek qaum ko wuzu khane se wuzu karte dekha, to unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Ayyub par — un par aur hamare Nabi par salat o salam ho — sone ki tidiyan barsain, to woh unhen lene lage. To Allah ne un ki taraf wahi farmai: Kya main ne tumhen wus'at nahin di? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin Aey mere Rabb, lekin main Tere fazl se be-niyaz nahin hun."
"87","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Musa — un par aur hamare Nabi par salat o salam ho — bahut haya dar aur parda karne wale the; haya ki wajah se un ki khal ka kuch hissa nazar nahin aata tha. To Bani Israil mein se baaz ne unhen takleef di aur kaha: Yeh itna parda siwae is ke nahin karta ke us ki khal mein koi cheez hai, ya to bars hai ya udra ya koi beemari hai. To woh ghusl karne dakhil hue aur apne kapde pathar par rakhe to pathar un ke kapdon ke sath daud pada. To woh us ke peeche daudte hue nikle, to Bani Israil ne unhen mardon mein sab se husn khilqat dekha, aur Allah ne unhen us se bari kar diya jo woh kahte the. To wohi Allah Ta'ala ka qaul hai: «يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا لَا تَكُونُوا كَالَّذِينَ آذَوْا مُوسَى فَبَرَّأَهُ اللَّهُ» [33-Al-Ahzab:69].'"
"88","[AI-translation] Abu Zur'ah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath ek ghar mein dakhil hua jo Madina mein Sa'id ke liye ya Marwan ke liye banaya gaya tha. To Abu Hurairah ne wuzu kiya; unhon ne apne dono hath baghlon tak dhoe, aur apne dono paon ghutnon tak dhoe. To main ne Abu Hurairah se kaha: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak yeh taharat ki inteha hai. Rawi ne kaha: Phir unhon ne ek musawwir ko ghar mein tasweer banate dekha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: 'Us se badh kar zalim kaun hai jo meri makhlooq jaisi takhleeq karne laga? To woh zarra paida karen, woh dana paida karen.'"
"89","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baitul-khala mein dakhil hue, to main Aap ke paas pani ka lota laya. To Aap ne us se istinja farmaya, phir apne dono hathon ko zameen par mala, phir unhen dhoya. Phir main Aap ke paas doosra lota laya to Aap ne us se wuzu farmaya."
"90","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ke joote ka tasma toot jae to woh doosre mein na chale yahan tak ke use durust kare. Aur jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dhoe.'"
"91","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne unhen Iraq mein apne hath se apni peshani par marte dekha jabke woh kah rahe the: Aey Ahle Iraq! Tum gumaan karte ho ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot bolta hun taake tumhare liye khushi ho aur mujh par gunah ho? Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dhoe. Aur jab us ke joote ka tasma toot jae to woh doosre mein na chale yahan tak ke use durust kare.'"
"92","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"93","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah Ta'ala ne tayammum ki ayat nazil farmai to main na janta tha ke main kaise karun. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghar mein un ke paas aaya lekin unhen na paya. Kaha gaya: Woh us darje ki taraf nikal gae hain jidhar woh gae the, to main un ke peeche gaya; mera khayal hai unhon ne meri hajat ko pahchan liya. To woh khade hue, phir zameen par ek zarb lagai aur apne chehre aur dono hathon ka masah kiya, us par izafa nahin kiya. To main wapas aa gaya aur un se na poocha."
"94","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Dehat ke kuch log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham is rait mein teen aur chaar mahine rahte hain; ham mein nifas wali, haiza aur junubi hote hain, aur ham pani nahin pate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum par zameen (se tayammum) lazim hai.'"
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to apne hathon ko na jhatke, kyunke woh shaitan ke pankhe hain.'"
"96","[AI-translation] Main ne Abu Usamah se kaha: Kya Abdur Rahman bin Yazid bin Jabir ne tumhen Makhul se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mouzon aur odhni par masah karo, kyunke beshak yeh haq hai'? To Abu Usamah ne is ka iqrar kiya aur kaha: Han."
"97","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Paanch namazen aur Juma un ke darmiyan ke liye kaffara hain, us ke liye jo kabira gunahon se bache."
"98","[AI-translation] Main ne Abu Usamah se kaha: Kya Idrees bin Yazid Audi ne tumhen apne walid se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi namaz ke liye khada na ho jabke us mein takleef deh cheez ho'? To Abu Usamah ne is ka iqrar kiya aur kaha: Han."
"99","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo kahin ke paas aae aur us ki kahi hui baat ki tasdeeq kare, ya haiza ke paas aae, ya aurat ke paas us ki dubur mein aae to beshak woh us se bari hai jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hua.'"
"100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to naak jhade. Aur jab pathron se istinja kare to taaq adad mein kare.'"
"101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laae, to main ne Aap ke liye wuzu ka bartan rakha. To Aap ne teen teen martaba wuzu farmaya aur apne sar ka do martaba masah farmaya."
"102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel bin Abi Talib se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra ke paas gaya to unhon ne kaha: 'Tum kaun ho? To main ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel hun. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhari maan kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Raitah bint Ali ya falanah bint Ali. To unhon ne kaha: Khush aamdeed aey mere bhatije. To main ne kaha: Main tumhare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke wuzu ke bare mein poochne aaya hun. To unhon ne kaha: Han, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aate aur ham se milne aate. To Aap ne is bartan mein, ya is jaise bartan mein wuzu farmaya, aur woh ek mudd ke qareeb hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne dono hath dhoe, phir kulli ki, naak jhadi, aur chehra teen martaba dhoya, phir dono hath teen teen martaba dhoe, phir sar ka do martaba masah farmaya, aur kanon ke zahir aur batin ka masah farmaya, phir dono paon teen teen martaba dhoe. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Ibn Abbas mere paas aae aur mujh se is hadees ke bare mein poocha, to main ne unhen bataya. To unhon ne kaha: Log siwae dhone ke inkar karte hain, aur ham Kitabullah mein masah pate hain — yani: dono qadmon par.'"
"103","[AI-translation] Qabus bin Mukhariq se riwayat hai ke Husain bin Ali Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki god mein the, to unhon ne Aap par peshab kar diya. To Umm Fadl ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe apna kapda dikhaen taake main use dho dun. Rawi ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Umm Fadl! Beshak ladki ka peshab dhoya jata hai aur ladke ke peshab par pani chhidka jata hai.'"
"104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Lubabah bint Haris (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Husain bin Ali ko liya aur use apni god mein rakha, to unhon ne Aap par peshab kar diya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe apna tehband den taake main use dho dun. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak ladki ka peshab dhoya jata hai, aur ladke ke peshab par pani chhidka jata hai.'"
"105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Aiman (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe chatai do.' To unhon ne kaha: Beshak main haiza hun. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak tumhara haiz tumhare hath mein nahin hai.'"
"106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere pahlu mein the; jab woh sajda farmate to mera kapda un ke kapde ko lagta, jabke main haiza thi."
"107","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Amr auraton ko hukm dete the jab woh janabat se ghusl karen ke apne sar kholen. To yeh baat Aishah tak pahunchi to unhon ne kaha: Us ne unhen mashaqqat mein dal diya; woh unhen apne sar mundwane ka hukm kyun nahin deta? Beshak main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek hi bartan se ghusl karti thi aur main teen lapen se ziyada nahin dalti thi."
"108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sar mein kanghi karti thin jabke woh haiza thin."
"109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Habibah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Us se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.'"
"110","[AI-translation] Un ki phuphi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bakri ke shane ka gosht khaya, phir namaz padhi aur wuzu na kiya."
"111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ham tariyya ko kuch na samajhte the: gandlapan aur zardi.'"
"112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Subayyah Juhaniyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Kabhi mera hath aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka hath ek hi bartan se wuzu mein mukhtalif hote."
"113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan, Ukashah bin Mihsan ki bahan se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apne doodh peete bete ke sath aain aur use Aap ki god mein rakha. To us ne Aap par peshab kar diya. To Aap ne apne samne pyale mein se pani ki ek chullu li aur use us par dala, aur us par izafa nahin kiya."
"114","[AI-translation] Ibrahim (Nakha'i) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh witr ke baad do rak'aton se pahle miswak ko mustahab samajhte the."
"115","[AI-translation] Aur Mughirah ne kaha: Hasan ke maula se, Abu Ubaidah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke woh witr ke baad do rak'aton se pahle miswak karte the."
"116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do qabron par se guzre, to farmaya: Beshak yeh dono azab diye ja rahe hain, aur inhen kisi bade gunah mein azab nahin diya ja raha. Raha un mein se ek to woh chughli khate phirta tha, aur raha doosra to woh apne peshab se parda nahin karta tha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ki taaza tehni mangwai, to use do hisson mein cheera, phir is par ek aur is par ek gaad di aur farmaya: Shayad un se takhfeef ki jae jab tak yeh khushk na hon."
"117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do qabron par se guzre, to farmaya: Beshak yeh dono azab diye ja rahe hain, aur inhen kisi bade gunah mein azab nahin diya ja raha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahin, raha un mein se ek — phir rawi ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"118","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah ya Madina ke baghat mein se ek bagh par se guzre, to Aap ne do insanon ki awaz suni jo apni qabron mein azab diye ja rahe the. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak yeh dono azab diye ja rahe hain aur inhen kisi bade gunah mein azab nahin diya ja raha: un mein se ek chughli khate phirta tha, aur doosra apne peshab se parda nahin karta tha. Phir Aap ne tehni li aur use do tukdon mein toda, phir un dono mein se har qabr par ek tukda rakha. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne yeh kyun kiya? To Aap ne farmaya: Shayad un se takhfeef ki jae jab tak yeh khushk na hon, ya yahan tak ke khushk hon."
"120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the to Aap baitul-khala se nikle aur khana laya gaya. To un se kaha gaya: Kya Aap wuzu nahin farmayenge? To Aap ne farmaya: Kyun? Kya main namaz padhunga to wuzu karunga."
"121","[AI-translation] Amr se isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum zaya na karte, to main tumhen har namaz ke waqt miswak ka hukm deta."
"123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Un ki khala ki paltu bakri mar gai to unhon ne use phenk diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne us ki khal se faida kyun na uthaya?"
